        { q: 'What is the writer\'s main conclusion?', options: ['Four days are sufficient for any organisation.', 'The trials prove the policy should be adopted nationally.', 'The results reveal how poorly the five-day week was being used.', 'The policy works only in small companies.'], answer: 2 }
