        { q: 'Why does the writer consider better product information more effective than return fees?', options: ['It deals with the reason customers return goods.', 'It is cheaper to introduce.', 'Customers refuse to pay any fees.', 'It allows in-store returns to remain free.'], answer: 0 },
        { q: 'What does the final sentence suggest?', options: ['Return policies should be abolished.', 'New sellers should copy large retailers.', 'A generous promise can cancel out the profit it helps to create.', 'Accurate descriptions guarantee sales.'], answer: 2 }
