        { q: 'Which concern is connected with the ninety-nine-year leases?', options: ['Flats cannot be sold before the lease ends.', 'Leases are too short for young couples to qualify.', 'The state may increase the length of leases.', 'Owners of older flats face uncertainty about value and retirement funds.'], answer: 3 },
        { q: 'According to the final paragraph, what may be the system\'s greatest achievement?', options: ['Its innovative architecture', 'Its low prices', 'Making large-scale public housing seem normal', 'Ending all political debate about housing'], answer: 2 }
